---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { guides } from '../../data/guides';
---
<Base title="Audacity 中文教程｜从安装、录音到剪辑与导出" description="按任务查找 Audacity 中文使用教程：下载安装、麦克风录音、Windows 电脑内录、音频剪辑、降噪、MP3 导出与 FFmpeg 安装排查。"><div class="container"><header class="page-heading"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">首页</a> / 使用教程</div><span class="eyebrow">LEARN BY DOING</span><h1>带着一个问题，找到下一步。</h1><p class="lead">按你正在做的事情查找。每篇都标注适用版本，并附官方参考资料。</p><label for="guide-search" class="fine">搜索教程</label><br /><input id="guide-search" class="filter-input" type="search" placeholder="试试：录音、MP3、降噪…" /></header><div class="cards" id="guide-list">{guides.map((g,i) => <a class="card" data-search={`${g.title} ${g.intro} ${g.category}`} href={`/guides/${g.slug}/`}><div class="card-num"><span>0{i+1} / {g.category}</span><span>↗</span></div><h2 style="font-size:19px;line-height:1.6">{g.short}</h2><p>{g.intro}</p><div class="card-bottom"><span>约 {g.minutes} 分钟阅读</span><span>→</span></div></a>)}</div><p class="empty-search" id="search-empty" role="status" hidden>没有找到相关教程。换一个关键词，或查看常见问题。</p><div class="section"><div class="callout"><div><h2>遇到无声、打不开或导出失败？</h2><p>先检查设备、文件格式和版本，再处理具体错误。</p></div><a class="button secondary" href="/faq/">查看常见问题 →</a></div></div></div></Base>
<script>
const input = document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#guide-search');
input?.addEventListener('input', () => { let count=0; const q=input.value.trim().toLocaleLowerCase(); document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-search]').forEach(card=>{card.hidden=!(card.dataset.search||'').toLocaleLowerCase().includes(q); if(!card.hidden)count++;}); const empty=document.getElementById('search-empty'); if(empty)empty.hidden=count>0; });
</script>
